WEBVTT

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:09.440
73,800...

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:12.820
73,801...

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.260
Ever since the day my mother left me,

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.120
I've gotten used to being left behind.

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:27.280
But I'll see you again soon...

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.940
Because that is why my life exists.

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:35.660
Oh my!

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:38.190
Are you not scared of dying, perhaps?

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:41.550
I'm prepared to die for my beliefs.

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:43.890
And...

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:46.500
It's much easier than 
sacrificing anybody else.

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:50.290
What? Is that what you really think?

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:53.490
Is that why you've counted 
all the sins you must bear?

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:59.340
You're doing it for yourself, not for them.

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:02.560
Someone inhuman like you 
wouldn't understand.

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:45.220
I'm done!

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:47.870
I thought I'd never finish.

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:49.350
<b>Episode 10
An Tiki Thera</b>

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:49.430
Congratulations.

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:52.300
Thank you, Hibiki.

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:56.990
I should be thanking you for
 helping me with my homework.

00:02:56.990 --> 00:02:58.020
Why?

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:03.750
You kept your promise to do your best 
with your homework and your mission.

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:09.520
I'm just picking the easy thing to do.

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:12.880
I'm not smart enough to choose just one.

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:15.840
So in the end, I'm just being selfish.

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:18.980
Maybe that's like you, Hibiki.

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:20.260
Like me?

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:22.120
Yes!

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:25.690
It seems it's very soon!

00:03:25.690 --> 00:03:27.680
Yes, just two days left!

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:31.180
Just two days until Hibiki-san's birthday—

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:37.900
What's wrong, everyone?

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:40.350
Chris-san told me!

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:42.460
About Hibiki-chan's birthday?

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:45.210
Chris-chan was talking about my birthday?

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:48.030
You remembered it!

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:50.330
It was just by chance. Chance.

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:53.130
But she sure was nervous about it.

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:54.040
Yes!

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:56.770
She was exploding with 
easy-to-understand-ness!

00:03:57.820 --> 00:03:59.500
Quiet, you two!

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:02.250
It's almost time to go to HQ!

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:05.820
You're here?

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:08.340
I'll start the briefing, then.

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:09.610
Pull up the footage.

00:04:09.610 --> 00:04:10.470
Yes, sir.

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:16.700
The traditions and old 
scrolls at Tsuki Shrine,

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:19.050
as well as our battles with the alchemists,

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:21.110
indicate the enemy's next 
move will be to create

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:25.070
the power of a god from the 
gate from which gods emerge,

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:31.320
a copy of the Orion constellation 
inscribed on the ground.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:39.100
We're working with the Jinja Hochou 
to strengthen security and evacuate the area.

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:44.340
An even larger-scale ritual 
using the ley lines.

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:54.100
How many monsters do they plan to make?

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:58.150
What will emerge from the gate is 
a god that surpasses monsters...

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:00.900
Can we beat it?

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:03.140
We have to.

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:05.830
If anything can beat it,

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:08.660
it'll be the power of the God-killer.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:10.420
The God-killer?

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:11.270
What is that?

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:19.430
Legends from all over the world speak of 
the deaths of beings worshiped as gods.

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:23.230
Records show that German eugenics 
programs during the last world war

00:05:23.230 --> 00:05:26.920
involved collecting powers that 
could potentially kill a god.

00:05:27.790 --> 00:05:28.820
Which means...

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:30.890
I'm afraid that's...

00:05:32.170 --> 00:05:35.390
The Valverde documents 
that may have helped us,

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:39.920
and the old Kazanari HQ that 
held documents from the war,

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:44.070
were destroyed by Controlling 
Director Adam Weishaupt.

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:50.720
But... could we interpret their 
carefully planned actions

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:56.900
as an attempt to conceal the
existence of the god-killing power?

00:05:57.350 --> 00:06:01.720
If so, that may imply that it exists!

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:05.070
The God-killer...

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:06.880
...is actually...

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:07.970
Ogawa.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:09.090
Roger.

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:14.470
Intelligence will work with world 
governments to gather information.

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:17.510
I'm counting on you.

00:06:24.890 --> 00:06:29.000
The god-killing power,
fighting the power of the gods...

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:38.070
Could it be within the Gungnir?

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:41.000
I thought of that, as well.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.500
But even if it did come from Germany,

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:47.010
I've never heard of any legends 
involving it killing gods.

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:51.870
All we can do for now is wait.

00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:58.900
Until the recoil pollution 
is removed from our Gears...

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:01.220
Death!

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:04.580
Everybody, I have a suggestion!

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:09.460
On the 13th, two days from now, why don't 
we hold a birthday party for Hibiki-san?

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:12.650
You're saying that now? 
You're saying it now?

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:14.740
Is it a problem?

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:17.430
No, no... I'm happy.

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:20.490
But right now things are pretty tense.

00:07:20.490 --> 00:07:23.640
Kirika-chan and I are the 
only ones who can fight.

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:25.750
You only get one birthday a year!

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:27.660
But...

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:31.760
It's your actual birthday, 
so we have to celebrate it!

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:34.780
Don't cause problems for her.

00:07:34.780 --> 00:07:36.590
You're too easygoing.

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:38.800
Too easygoing?

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:41.390
It's okay! Hurry up and evacuate.

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:44.390
You really think it's okay, huh?

00:07:44.390 --> 00:07:46.350
You easygoing girl!

00:07:52.550 --> 00:07:54.820
Oh, my. Whose fault was that?

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:59.910
Did my being easygoing 
cause problems for you?

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:03.760
No! Not at all! I'm grateful!

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:13.520
Blue 1! Blue 1!

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:14.420
What happened?

00:08:14.420 --> 00:08:16.290
Blue 2!  Come in!

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:20.280
73,808.

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:23.440
73,809.

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:29.040
73,810. 73,811.

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:33.040
If all these guys are standing around,

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:36.490
that means they know about our plan, right?

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:38.580
What are you going to do, Saint Germain?

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.760
Nothing.

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:49.350
I'll use the life energy I've gathered 
 to place the central control altar.

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:58.630
Jade twinkles in the sky, 
what men called the dying erde.

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:04.140
The whirlwind blows, and the 
flames from beyond rise high.

00:09:08.300 --> 00:09:10.120
Commander, this is...

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:12.060
Contact everyone immediately!

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:27.210
The missing energy that is still needed to 
open the gate shall be provided by my life...

00:09:31.490 --> 00:09:32.500
Yes.

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:35.460
Yes. Yes. Understood.

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:37.240
Hibiki?

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:38.340
I have to go.

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:40.790
Wait—

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:44.550
Sorry.

00:09:49.280 --> 00:09:53.070
It's fine. My birthday's soon.

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:55.440
So I'll be back soon.

00:09:55.890 --> 00:09:56.680
Okay.

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:23.680
Adam?

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:27.530
<i>Everything seems to be going well.</i>

00:10:27.530 --> 00:10:30.890
Yup! It's thanks to Saint Germain!

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:39.650
When the twin Orions of Heaven and Earth

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:43.050
face each other according to the 
aspects laid out in the ritual,

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:45.950
the gate will be drawn on the horoscope.

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:50.530
My job is to find that time and location.

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:52.540
And then...

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:57.030
What is this?

00:10:58.300 --> 00:10:59.520
Father?

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:03.330
<i>We're ready when you are.</i>

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:09.420
I need to hurry. The Bavarian Illuminati's 
plan is moving faster than I am.

00:11:18.470 --> 00:11:22.040
<i>Cagliostro... Prelati...</i>

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:25.920
<i>I won't let your sacrifice go to waste.</i>

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:27.980
<i>And mother...</i>

00:11:28.530 --> 00:11:32.420
<i>To have a revolution against 
all control... I will...</i>

00:11:34.070 --> 00:11:35.490
<i>I will...</i>

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:48.770
The gate from which gods emerge has opened!

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:52.320
<i>The life of the planet, 
extracted from the ley lines...</i>

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:57.320
<i>I'll add to it the concept of a 
subservient and blind young girl.</i>

00:12:02.390 --> 00:12:04.100
It's entering me!

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:11.590
Look! Something crazy is happening!

00:12:11.590 --> 00:12:13.390
That's...

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:17.160
The copy of Orion!

00:12:17.890 --> 00:12:21.330
Energy is converging towards the 
observation point via the ley lines!

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:25.170
The power of a god is about to 
manifest from within the gate.

00:12:25.170 --> 00:12:26.440
<i>Match me, Gen!</i>

00:12:26.730 --> 00:12:28.290
Right, brother!

00:12:28.690 --> 00:12:29.640
Execute...

00:12:29.870 --> 00:12:31.090
...decision!

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:32.810
<b>Activating Keystones</b>

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:47.650
Detecting simultaneous activation of 
keystones at all ley lines point!

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:50.110
Our plan to shut down the ley lines worked!

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:54.080
You've shown too many 
of your cards, alchemists.

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:57.540
Don't mess with the govenrment.

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:04.740
It's not here... It's not here...

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:08.850
Tiki?

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:20.660
<i>Balwisyall nescell Gungnir tron.</i>

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:50.060
This is the end for you!

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:51.960
Symphogears...

00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:53.330
You just won't leave us alone!

00:14:00.970 --> 00:14:03.310
Do we have to fight?

00:14:03.310 --> 00:14:07.710
You and I both hold our
 own justice in our hands...

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:09.570
So there is no other path!

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:15.460
<i>Beliefs and destiny aren't about 
the weight they put on you</i>

00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:20.510
<i>But for some reason my straight 
line isn't understood</i>

00:14:20.510 --> 00:14:23.390
<i>My voice just isn't heard</i>

00:14:23.390 --> 00:14:25.710
<i>A reckless Believe song</i>

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:26.910
Gungnir and Igalima are engaged in combat!

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:28.550
<i>Save (Fight!) the world (Fight!)</i>

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:29.190
Their unison values are steady!

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:31.250
<i>Love (fight!) is diffraction (Fight!)</i>

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:33.920
<i>Don't look at the words 
I say before we're done</i>

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:38.340
<i>Look at how I really feel</i>

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:38.350
<b>Dual Slash Cinderella</b>

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:43.930
<i>I just want to sing, I just 
want to resonate together</i>

00:14:43.930 --> 00:14:46.440
<i>To the heavens (Shoutin'!) 
to our dreams (Shoutin'!)</i>

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:48.990
<i>Go! Go! Go! Go! Make it come try!</i>

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:54.370
<i>A strike of certain love, 
bringing bonds together passionately</i>

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:56.720
<i>A true (Shoutin'!) heart...</i>

00:15:01.870 --> 00:15:03.590
Using the power of a god...

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:13.210
<i>Carrying a resolve that's true to yourself</i>

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:10.670
I will take control of the lunar ruins from 
those without the weight of their beliefs.

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:14.290
I'll release this world 
from the Curse of Balal,

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:16.890
and put an end to the history of control!

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:21.230
Even if that's true...

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:24.080
If doing that means you have 
to sacrifice someone...

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:25.060
That's right!

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:30.360
32,831 sacrifices and 40,977 victims!

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:32.680
The sins I bear and their weight...

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:35.860
mean I can no longer change my mind!

00:15:41.510 --> 00:15:42.430
Hibiki-san!

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:47.170
You're kidding!

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:51.440
<i>A true (Shoutin'!) heart...</i>

00:15:51.440 --> 00:15:52.840
<i>Go! (Go!) Go! (Go!)</i>

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:58.610
<i>Believe it will be heard and protect today</i>

00:15:58.610 --> 00:16:07.190
<i>Carrying a resolve that's true to yourself</i>

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:04.690
<b>Certain Love Strike Duo Shout</b>

00:16:18.690 --> 00:16:21.220
For the sake of this planet's tomorrow...

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:24.500
So that no one's heart will ever...

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:27.340
Stay away from me, slave!

00:16:30.900 --> 00:16:32.010
Mother?

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:34.520
Mother?

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:42.660
...have shame like that 
carved into it again...

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:46.030
I will revolt against control!

00:16:58.210 --> 00:17:02.270
I've always believed in justice, 
and clenched it in my hands.

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:03.700
But...

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:09.590
I know there are things you 
can't change with fists.

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:12.220
So...

00:17:16.020 --> 00:17:18.990
I'm not afraid to open my clenched fist.

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:27.910
It's wrong to use the power of a god 
to remove a curse the gods laid.

00:17:28.430 --> 00:17:31.750
People need to change while remaining human.

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:38.700
Even if that's true...

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:43.950
The power to change something
 can always come

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:49.240
from an unshakeable resolve that 
says "Even if that's true..."

00:17:52.010 --> 00:17:55.010
That's enough of this farce.

00:18:05.710 --> 00:18:07.360
What's going on?

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:08.850
This is...

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:10.700
Ley lines in the sky?

00:18:11.430 --> 00:18:17.220
Adam gathered life not from this 
planet but from the stars,

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:21.220
using the Orion constellation itself 
as the gate from which gods emerge...

00:18:21.920 --> 00:18:25.070
Correspondence between the 
macro and microcosms

00:18:25.070 --> 00:18:29.310
is one of the fundamental
 principles of alchemy, but I...

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:31.390
Adam...

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:35.830
Adam came...

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:42.810
Another gate from which the gods emerge...

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:46.010
...opened in the sea of stars.

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:48.480
Ultra high-level energy, incoming!

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:56.220
You can't cut it off if 
it's beyond the horizon.

00:18:56.220 --> 00:18:57.700
I'll stop you!

00:19:01.350 --> 00:19:02.600
Hey, you!

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:06.190
Tell me, Controlling Director!

00:19:06.550 --> 00:19:12.160
Can this power really release 
mankind from the bonds of control?

00:19:12.550 --> 00:19:15.930
It can... Probably.

00:19:16.310 --> 00:19:20.300
But I have no intention of doing so.

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:22.880
I never did.

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:25.600
You tricked me?

00:19:26.210 --> 00:19:29.590
Cagliostro, Prelati...

00:19:29.590 --> 00:19:32.620
All the lives which were sacrificed 
for the revolution...

00:19:32.930 --> 00:19:35.520
I'm done with you, too.

00:19:44.840 --> 00:19:46.410
This power...

00:19:53.340 --> 00:20:03.420
<i>Emustolronzen fine el zizzl...</i>

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:07.150
I may be easygoing, yeah.

00:20:07.150 --> 00:20:09.890
But if there isn't at least 
one easygoing person

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:12.250
who isn't carrying any burderns of her own,

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:16.360
who'll carry the heavy burden 
when it comes time to do so?

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:18.520
A Climax Song?

00:20:18.520 --> 00:20:19.990
No!

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:25.990
Kirika-chan!

00:20:26.510 --> 00:20:29.070
You tried to stop it with your 
Climax Song? That's crazy...

00:20:30.610 --> 00:20:33.660
Hibiki-san, it's almost 
time for your birthday.

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:38.410
It's important to have lots of birthdays.

00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:40.880
Now's not the time!

00:20:41.560 --> 00:20:46.340
I don't know when my birthday is...

00:20:48.360 --> 00:20:53.320
So I want to treasure other 
people's birthdays instead.

00:20:57.090 --> 00:20:58.270
LiNKER?

00:20:58.270 --> 00:21:02.130
She overdosed on it to minimize 
the stress from the Climax Song?

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:04.750
But the effects on her body...

00:21:04.750 --> 00:21:07.480
Kiri-chan! Kiri-chan!

00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:07.080
Bring her in immediately!

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:10.980
Get a medical team out there, 
and prepare for an internal flushing!

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:09.400
Kiri-chan, can you hear me?

00:21:09.780 --> 00:21:12.470
Kiri-chan! Kiri-chan!

00:21:10.980 --> 00:21:11.730
Yes, sir!

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:15.160
I won't let you touch them.

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:20.450
Is that the answer you chose?

00:21:21.490 --> 00:21:25.530
If you seek to monopolize
 the power of the gods,

00:21:25.530 --> 00:21:28.860
then you are the ruler 
that stands in my way.

00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:31.970
You're quite stubborn.

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:35.440
Perhaps that's why I find you so annoying.

00:21:35.760 --> 00:21:39.910
But the power of the gods
 will soon be complete.

00:21:39.910 --> 00:21:44.220
And then, you utterly unable to stop me.

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:48.520
You and I are enemies,

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:51.260
clutching our own justice, 
unable to come to an understanding.

00:21:51.260 --> 00:21:56.280
But now we're looking the same 
direction, at the same enemy.

00:21:56.280 --> 00:21:59.320
The enemy is powerful. Overwhelming.

00:21:59.320 --> 00:22:02.100
So what will you do, Hibiki Tachibana?

00:22:02.740 --> 00:22:06.710
There's only one thing to stay true 
to when you're fighting back.

00:22:07.390 --> 00:22:08.930
"Even if that's true!"
